      520.61,
      562.85,
      604.55
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01, 02, 03, 04, 05, 06Name of Land: Kiriporuwa Part II; Claimants Name andAddress: 01. Lands Reform Commission No. 475, KaduwelaRoad, Battaramulla. 02. Managing Director Kegalle PlantationsPLC No. 310, High-level Road, Maharagama. 03. Ministry ofPlantation Industries Second Floor, Sethsiripaya, Stage II,Battaramulla; Extent: 1.8729 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
